{
  "name": "l-thermopylae-full",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 95.37,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "In 480 BC, the largest empire the world had yet seen marched on the small cities of Greece.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.112,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Its king, Xerxes, ruled from Egypt to the Indus.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.878,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Ten years earlier, Athens had beaten his father's army at Marathon.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.196,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Xerxes wanted revenge.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.854,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "His army marched south along the coast, with his fleet beside it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.498,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "To reach Athens, it had to pass one narrow gap between the mountains and the sea.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.545,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Thermopylae.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.915,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "68209956b4ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Waiting there: about seven thousand Greeks.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.114,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "a59ab0138b62"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Their leader, the Spartan king Leonidas, had brought three hundred of his own men, all fathers with sons at home.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.39,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "a59ab0138b62"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "According to Plutarch, Xerxes told them to hand over their weapons.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.138,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "a59ab0138b62"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Leonidas replied: come and take them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.22,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "a59ab0138b62"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Herodotus claimed over two million men.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.474,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "a59ab0138b62"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Historians today think far fewer, but still many times the Greeks.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.976,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "a59ab0138b62"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Xerxes waited four days for them to run.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.014,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "On the fifth, he attacked.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.756,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "For two days, his army could not break through.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.164,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Not even his elite guard, the Immortals.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.653,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Then a local Greek, Ephialtes, showed the Persians a path over the mountain.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.15,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Leonidas sent most of the Greeks away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.466,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "He stayed with his three hundred and seven hundred men from Thespiae.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.884,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Almost all of them died.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.637,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "f0d0465eb156"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Xerxes marched on and burned Athens.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.808,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "6ae1a3982cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "But the victory did not last.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.807,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "6ae1a3982cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "Weeks later, his fleet was crushed at Salamis.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.879,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "6ae1a3982cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "The next year, his army was driven from Greece.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.017,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "6ae1a3982cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s10",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.15,
      "text": "At the pass, a stone still carries their epitaph.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.173,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "6ae1a3982cb2"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s10",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.35,
      "text": "Go tell the Spartans, passer-by, that here we lie, obedient to their laws.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/l-thermopylae-full/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.652,
      "tempo": 1.1,
      "hash": "6ae1a3982cb2"
    }
  ]
}
